WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.990
Many clinicians record in the exam
room and finish notes at their desk.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.470
Here's that workflow for one appointment.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.830
On iPhone, tap Record
and choose your patient.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:13.350
For this visit, we'll use the
general SOAP and discharge templates.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:16.017
Tap Start Recording.

00:00:16.347 --> 00:00:20.417
Hold Pause when you need a break,
then tap Resume recording to continue.

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:23.777
When you're finished, hold
Finish and transcribe.

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:26.737
You can also choose an existing
audio file from your phone.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.373
The recording uploads from your phone.

00:00:29.373 --> 00:00:31.933
It's safe to leave this
screen: the recording stays

00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:34.163
on the device until the upload is done.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.973
noctune emails you when
the note is ready, and you

00:00:36.973 --> 00:00:39.043
can open it on iPhone or on the web.

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.190
Back at your desk, open
noctune on the web.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.840
The same appointment
appears in Encounters, and

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:46.830
shows Ready when the draft is prepared.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:50.650
Review the clinical note against
the transcript and audio.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:52.980
Click a highlighted
citation or annotation to

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:55.210
jump to the matching audio and transcript.

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:58.010
Check the patient details,
findings, and plan.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.810
The draft is a starting point
for your clinical review.

00:01:01.473 --> 00:01:04.583
Choose Edit to make
corrections, then Save.

00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:07.543
When your review is
finished, choose Complete.

00:01:07.793 --> 00:01:11.223
Saving an edit and completing
the encounter are separate steps.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.420
Review your discharge
instructions, then choose

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:17.050
Send Email and Send discharge notes.

00:01:17.445 --> 00:01:19.275
Every account can send them.

00:01:19.285 --> 00:01:23.275
Without Nest, discharge emails
use no reply by default.

00:01:23.365 --> 00:01:27.595
Confirm the recipient before sending;
drafts are never sent automatically.

00:01:28.327 --> 00:01:32.157
With noctune Nest, clients can reply
through a private relay address.

00:01:32.247 --> 00:01:34.967
Your personal email
stays hidden, and replies

00:01:34.967 --> 00:01:37.837
return to noctune,
linked to the encounter.

00:01:38.007 --> 00:01:41.837
On iPhone or on the web, the
follow-up stays with the visit.
